## Anonymous Session Model

```prisma
model AnonymousSession {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  distribution Json     // AxisDistribution
  askedIds     String[] // question IDs asked so far
  mandateJson  Json?    // completed Mandate if dialogue done
  userId       String?  // null until email auth; set at execution time
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime @updatedAt
}
```

The session ID is stored in a cookie (anonymous, not auth-linked).
Session is linked to `User` after email verification via `POST /api/auth/link-session`.

