## LLM Integration

```typescript
// Q5–Q7 selection only
const prompt = buildReasoningPrompt(session); // from lib/inquisitor/index.ts
const response = await anthropic.messages.create({
  model: 'claude-sonnet-4-6',
  max_tokens: 200,
  system: 'You are the Inquisitor agent selecting the next question. Return only valid JSON.',
  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }],
});
const { selected_question_id, reasoning } = JSON.parse(response.content[0].text);
```

Fallback if JSON parse fails: use fixed Q5→Q6→Q7 order. Never crash — always return a question.

