## Educational Insert — Client Side

Handle educational inserts entirely in the React component. Do NOT make an API call for them.

```tsx
// When user selects an answer with educationalInsert:
if (selectedOption.triggersInsert && question.educationalInsert) {
  setInsertState({ visible: true, insert: question.educationalInsert });
  // Don't submit answer yet — wait for "Got it!" click
} else {
  submitAnswer(questionId, optionId);
}

// On "Got it!" click:
setInsertState({ visible: false });
submitAnswer(questionId, optionId); // now submit the original answer
```

